        "primary_estimand": "Effect of loss of mechanical stress (knee immobilization + tail-suspension unloading, MMS) on synovium gene expression over time (D3/D7/D14 vs control), and its reversal by restored joint motion (R1) or motion + loading (R2). This is a disuse/unloading model, not an exercise intervention; R1/R2 are remobilization/reloading.",
        "planned_contrasts": [
          "each MMS time point vs Control (synovium); R1 and R2 vs Control/MMS — shown only as heatmaps/module patterns (S2.3.p1/S2.4.p1, Figs 2-4); no DEG counts reported",
